    {
      "id": "s_col_4p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6245,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "c = neutral-axis depth below the compression edge; p = fibre coordinate from the centroid along",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_4q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6275,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "θM, so R − p = fibre depth. The plane pivots about A (extreme bar at −εud, c &lt; cA), B (edge at",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_4r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6305,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "εcu2, c ≤ D) or C (εc2 at depth yC, c &gt; D), EC2 Fig. 6.1.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_4s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6381,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strain at fibre p for depth c",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_4t",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 6335,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon\\left(c,p\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{|ll}\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{ud}\\frac{c-R+p}{d_{\\theta}-c} & \\mathrm{if}\\ c<c_{A}\\\\\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{cu2}\\frac{c-R+p}{c} & \\mathrm{if}\\ c\\le D\\\\\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{c2}\\frac{c-R+p}{c-y_{C}} & \\mathrm{otherwise}\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
