      "x": 80,
      "y": 10178,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "7.2 Strut angle",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10218,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Spirals carry VEd through a truss: concrete struts at angle θ, spirals as ties (EC2 6.2.3).",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10248,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Compression: a flatter strut (larger cotθ) needs fewer spirals, but the strut crushes",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10278,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "when VEd &gt; VRd,max = bw·z·ν1·fcd / (cotθ + tanθ). So cotθ is the largest value with",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10308,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "cotθ + tanθ ≤ a = bw·z·ν1·fcd / VEd, capped at 2.5 (a ≥ 2.9 gives 2.5; a &lt; 2 fails).",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10348,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strut ratio a: limit of cotθ + tanθ for this VEd",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6z",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 10348,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "a\\coloneq\\frac{b_{w}z\\nu_{1}f_{cd.v}}{V_{Ed}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_70",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10626,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "The strut can carry VEd at θ = 45°",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_71",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 10619,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "a\\ge2",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_72",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10663,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Largest cotθ: larger root of cotθ + 1/cotθ = a (≤ 2.5)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_73",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 10699,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\mathrm{cot}_{\\theta.opt}\\coloneq\\min\\left(2.5,0.5\\left(a+\\sqrt{\\max\\left(a^2-4,0\\right)}\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 2,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_74",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10749,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Tension (NEd &lt; 0): θ from CSA A23.3, θ = 29° + 7000·εx, εx = strain at mid-depth from",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_75",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10779,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "the tension chord force; cotθ is kept between 1 and cotθ,opt. Compression uses cotθ,opt.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_76",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10836,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
